    "sub_name": "介面設計",
    "sub_ename": "INTERFACE DESIGN",
    "describe_ch": "本課程的主要目的在於介紹(1)各種不同功能的輸入/輸出介面硬體結構與工作原理。(2)如何設定不同的指令完成不同的工作模式。(3)如何設計軟體程式完成不同介面的工作以及與CPU之間資料的傳輸。\n",
    "describe_eh": "The object of this course is to introduce the following topics.(1)Introducing the hardware structure and the operation for different I/O interfaces.(2) Introducing the different commands for different operational models in each I/O interface.(3) Introducing the programming to complete different I/O operations and the data transfer between I/O interface and CPU.",
    "pre_subname": "IEE1006邏輯設計、ELEN2012微處理機系統",
    "pre_sub_id3": "IEE1006",
    "pre_sub_ename": "IEE1006 LOGIC DESIGN、ELEN2012 MICROPROCESSOR SYSTEMS",
